OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMural of WW2 hero on council
OL,4,Abuilding complete
OL,5,
OL,6,FErewash Borough Council said the
OL,7,Fseven-metre tall mural - which was
OL,8,Frevealed after scaffolding was removed
OL,9,Ffrom Ilkeston Town Hall on Saturday -
OL,10,Fpromoted remembrance and celebrated
OL,11,FRose's "extraordinary life and
OL,12,Fservice", while also recognising the
OL,13,Fcontribution of all Armed Forces
OL,14,Fpersonnel.
OL,16,FCouncillor Mark Alfrey, lead member for
OL,17,Fenvironment, said it was a "beautiful
OL,18,Fway to honour Donald".
